    // e.g. '2023-10-01T00:00Z'.
    // We append the time because the JS Date constructor can't parse
    // pre-1000 dates with a timezone, for example '0032-01-01Z' parses
    // as '2032-01-01T00:00:00.000Z'.
    return `${dt}T00:00:00Z`
